  "description": "Daniele, a cardinal renowned for both his beauty and his promising future, is tormented by the reality of a Church rife with corrupt clergy. He prays fervently for the power to set things right.\n\nOn the eve of Christmas, his devout prayers reach heaven, and a revelation is granted: if he continues to wear a holy relic bestowed upon him, his wish will be fulfilled.\n\nThe relic takes the form of a women’s corset, leaving Daniele shaken, but he does not dare doubt divine will and keeps it on. As the unfamiliar undergarment and the constant confrontation with a corrupted reality push him to his limits, Daniele seeks a moment of respite in the confessional.\n\nThere, a man enters the booth opposite him. It is Carlo, a famed war hero, who asks the priest to absolve him of the sin of lust he feels toward a man of the cloth…\n\n---\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[Bomtoon](https://www.bomtoon.com/detail/devilslust)\n\n**Official Translations:**    \nJapanese: [Beltoon](https://www.beltoon.jp/detail/devilslust), [Lezhin](https://lezhin.jp/comic/devilslust)",
